  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach paid shop refresh grants
    2 gold per talent immediately, capped at 6 gold total per refresh. Each refresh
    during the run also adds 3% weapon damage to this ally, up to 30%, for the next
    prepared battle.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Chest quality: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA navigator transformed by
    crossing incompatible dreams. Their needle answers freely made commitments, not
    an owner's commands. They are learning to choose a destination after a lifetime
    of being asked only for directions.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic
    personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their
    stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: archive, hare,
    archer. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
